> *To:* Joseph Salowey <joe@salowey.net>; <tls@ietf.org> <tls@ietf.org>
> *Subject:* Re: [TLS] 2nd WGLC for Delegated Credentials for TLS
>
>
> I=E2=80=99d still like to see test vectors.
>
>

