<div style=3D"margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">
<div style=3D"margin:0px"></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><font size=3D"4">I also think that test vectors w=
ould be good as well as a link to a formal verification publication (if ava=
ilable).</font></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><font size=3D"4"><br>
</font></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><font size=3D"4">Please see all my comments inlin=
e, I hope they help.<br>
</font></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><font size=3D"4"><br>
</font></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</blockquote>
<div><font size=3D"4">[Joe] Thanks,=C2=A0 I didn&#39;t get through these ye=
t.=C2=A0 The authors should take a look.=C2=A0</font></div>
<div><font size=3D"4">
